{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12329","headline":"夏日陪史郎中宴杜郎中果园 · 钱起","name":"夏日陪史郎中宴杜郎中果园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事重逢迎，春醪晚更清。\n林端花自老，池上月初明。\n路入仙郎次，乌连柱史名。\n竹阴疎柰院，山翠傍芜城。\n引满不辞醉，风来待曙更。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}